WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.714 --> 00:00:05.625
First, I'd like to thank you

00:00:05.708 --> 00:00:09.464
for raising the most beautiful woman
I have ever seen.

00:00:15.042 --> 00:00:16.458
And for allowing me to marry her.

00:00:16.856 --> 00:00:18.106
Thank you very much.

00:00:18.188 --> 00:00:19.125
-Thank you, Kola.
-Thank you.

00:00:19.208 --> 00:00:22.002
Thank you for standing by me
all these years.

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:29.375
I know everything.

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:31.583
When are you going to get that?

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.417
Soon, you'll be king.

00:00:33.706 --> 00:00:34.625
Yes.

00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:37.631
Hey, the man of the hour!

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:39.583
I don't think I can do this thing.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:46.542
-Do not embarrass me this day.
-I'm so sorry, Mommy.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.125
You're ready to get married
to a man who does this to you?

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.500
He beats me.

00:00:52.939 --> 00:00:57.468
So you're telling me you're willing
to let go of everything

00:00:57.538 --> 00:00:58.425
because of one slap?

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.247
It can't be that bad.

00:01:00.611 --> 00:01:02.509
You still want me
to do this at the wedding?

00:01:02.757 --> 00:01:03.757
Yeah.

00:01:05.083 --> 00:01:07.414
If anything happens to me,
look to our brother.

00:01:07.760 --> 00:01:11.722
What I do know
is that he was a very violent man.

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:15.583
-And you know what they say.
-What in God's name is going on?

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:17.000
If you live by the sword…

00:01:18.042 --> 00:01:19.917
I don't know. He just vanished.

00:01:20.434 --> 00:01:21.583
I can't find him anywhere.

00:01:23.964 --> 00:01:27.625
I need you to find
the people who did this…

00:01:30.597 --> 00:01:31.917
and make them suffer.

00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:37.500
Help me!

00:01:42.081 --> 00:01:44.414
Sarah, we're no longer good girls, okay?

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.364
We're fugitives now.

